! Rhizome - distributions in soil

Norbert Hartl  (norbert@apptivegrid.de)

""Abstract:""
Soil is an object-oriented database that provides object-oriented features which are missing in most other database systems. Currently it is limited to a single machine. The presentation gives an update to soil and the future plans how to escape the single machine and become more distributed. 

""Bio:""
Norbert Hartl has a long track record of creating and building software projects. Currently he is on a mission to create projects with zero dependencies. He co-founded ApptiveGrid where he is working at the moment. He also co-founded PharoPro. 
